{"date":"1994-12-16","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/34/68/72348_TS1zX.jpg"},"summary":"暴雨之夜，小茜（日高のり子 饰）接到一通请求除妖的电话，除妖地点在流幻泽。许多年前，天道一家曾旅行到过流幻泽，小茜在当地森林遇到过恐怖的怪物，关键时刻被一个少年救下，临别时还送给她一个护身符角笛。随着时间的流逝，那段记忆被长久深埋心中。这通电话唤醒了小茜对流幻泽的记忆和好奇，她留下一封信后只身前往。在当地，小茜重逢当时的少年真之介。真之介和爷爷居住在森林中的木屋里，辛苦地与受生命之泉影响而巨大化的动物作斗争。真之介当年为救小茜身负重伤，多亏生命之泉的水得以康复。然而生命之泉即将枯竭，这个少年命在旦夕…… ","name":"らんま1/2 SPECIAL よみがえる記憶","name_cn":"乱马1/2 苏醒的记忆","tags":[{"name":"OVA","count":63,"total_count":365723},{"name":"1994","count":29,"total_count":4254},{"name":"漫画改","count":21,"total_count":864559},{"name":"studiodeen","count":21,"total_count":26670},{"name":"乱马","count":21,"total_count":795},{"name":"搞笑","count":18,"total_count":640233},{"name":"漫改","count":14,"total_count":361929},{"name":"恋爱","count":11,"total_count":565801},{"name":"日髙のり子","count":8,"total_count":115},{"name":"草尾毅","count":8,"total_count":1106},{"name":"性转","count":7,"total_count":14545},{"name":"林原惠美","count":6,"total_count":674},{"name":"日本","count":6,"total_count":298601},{"name":"西村純二","count":4,"total_count":547},{"name":"动画","count":4,"total_count":35749},{"name":"高桥留美子","count":3,"total_count":4542},{"name":"后宫","count":3,"total_count":303960},{"name":"战斗","count":3,"total_count":473138},{"name":"动作","count":2,"total_count":7652},{"name":"1994年12月","count":2,"total_count":10},{"name":"山口亮太","count":2,"total_count":150},{"name":"日常","count":2,"total_count":401532},{"name":"日本动画","count":2,"total_count":34923},{"name":"奇幻","count":2,"total_count":473011},{"name":"童年","count":1,"total_count":93169},{"name":"1994年","count":1,"total_count":229},{"name":"Studio.DEEN","count":1,"total_count":208},{"name":"喜剧","count":1,"total_count":35489},